nt with Super OP Gear","textMapHash":3956841554,"text":"Hey there! I'm back! So then, how's the Arataki Blazing Armor Beetle Battle Boot Camp coming along...?","nextNodeIds":[716664002]},{"nodeId":716664002,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":485180810,"text":"Great timing, Yanfei!","nextNodeIds":[716664003]},{"nodeId":716664003,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":1959218130,"text":"My savior! Thanks for helping out with the permit! And for the sign with the epic artwork!","nextNodeIds":[716664004]},{"nodeId":716664004,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":2830770066,"text":"Wait, I know that look... Are you, uh, looking to flip some beetle too?","nextNodeIds":[716664005]},{"nodeId":716664005,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"Contestant with Super OP Gear","textMapHash":1202139162,"text":"Huh? Something wrong with that?","nextNodeIds":[716664006]},{"nodeId":716664006,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"Contestant with Super OP Gear","textMapHash":3544626058,"text":"I have a big client who does a lot of cross-border commerce — anyway, she showered me with gifts once after I helped her win a huge lawsuit, and among them was a very special Onikabuto.","nextNodeIds":[716664007]},{"nodeId":716664007,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"Contestant with Super OP Gear","textMapHash":675004730,"text":"I didn't know how to look after it at the time, so I got Granny to look after it for a while. It's looking pretty buff these days...","nextNodeIds":[716664008]},{"nodeId":716664008,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"Contestant with Super OP Gear","textMapHash":789679690,"text":"Mind if I join in? You're not worried I'll cramp your style, are you...?","nextNodeIds":[716664009]},{"nodeId":716664009,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30468,"speakerName":"Grandmaster Hanakado","textMapHash":819034402,"text":"We ought not dismiss your savior, Oni King. What she lacks in experience, she makes up for with one of the sturdiest-built and most awe-inspiring Onikabuto I have ever seen.","nextNodeIds":[716664010]},{"nodeId":716664010,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":3137893554,"text":"You make me an offer I can't refuse...","nextNodeIds":[716664011]},{"nodeId":716664011,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":244131106,"text":"Alright, time to send in the Oni King's Right Hand with Crimson Staff. I know my compadre will stay cool under pressure!","nextNodeIds":[716664012,716664013]},{"nodeId":716664012,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2389896946,"text":"You betcha!","nextNodeIds":[716664014]},{"nodeId":716664014,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"Contestant with Super OP Gear","textMapHash":3307024002,"text":"#So it's me versus {NICKNAME}? Alright!","nextNodeIds":[716664015]},{"nodeId":716664015,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30467,"speakerName":"Contestant with Super OP Gear","textMapHash":2400944930,"text":"I haven't quite got the hang of this game yet, so apologies in advance for any blunders.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":716664013,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":491340570,"text":"Thanks for the vote of confidence!","nextNodeIds":[716664014]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7166640,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","